1
00:00:01,140 --> 00:00:05,200
Here's a timeline we built
of the COVID-19 pandemic,

2
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:10,140
from the first reported cluster in Wuhan
at the end of 2019 to the end of the

3
00:00:10,190 --> 00:00:15,270
global health emergency
in May 2023. Emergencies,

4
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:19,110
lockdowns and waves are
bands; declarations,

5
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:24,560
discoveries and counts are moments,
each linked to the sources it draws on:

6
00:00:24,610 --> 00:00:29,063
WHO, health agencies, regulators
and scientific papers.

7
00:00:30,603 --> 00:00:35,013
On the last day of 2019, Wuhan's
health commission reports a cluster of

8
00:00:35,063 --> 00:00:41,013
pneumonia of unknown cause. Zoom into
the next month and it moves fast:

9
00:00:41,063 --> 00:00:46,613
a new coronavirus identified on January
ninth; its genome published two days

10
00:00:46,663 --> 00:00:51,493
later; a first case outside China;
human-to-human spread confirmed;

11
00:00:51,543 --> 00:00:55,483
Wuhan locked down on the
twenty-third; and on the thirtieth,

12
00:00:55,533 --> 00:01:01,563
WHO's highest alarm, a public health
emergency of international concern.

13
00:01:01,613 --> 00:01:05,243
Where the virus came from
has not been established.

14
00:01:05,293 --> 00:01:10,193
It remains under investigation and debated,
and the timeline cites WHO's reports

15
00:01:10,243 --> 00:01:12,014
on it, and leaves it there.

16
00:01:13,484 --> 00:01:18,484
On March eleventh, WHO says the
outbreak can be called a pandemic.

17
00:01:18,534 --> 00:01:23,424
Separate by tags, choose measures,
and the spring of 2020 stacks up:

18
00:01:23,474 --> 00:01:26,964
Italy's national lockdown
from March ninth, then Spain,

19
00:01:27,014 --> 00:01:30,744
France, England, India,
New Zealand, South Africa,

20
00:01:30,794 --> 00:01:35,334
within three weeks of each other.
Even the Tokyo Olympics moved,

21
00:01:35,384 --> 00:01:37,968
postponed on March twenty-fourth.

22
00:01:39,668 --> 00:01:44,358
Pull out the counts and they climb: one
million confirmed deaths by the end of

23
00:01:44,408 --> 00:01:51,958
September 2020, six million by March 2022.
But a confirmed death is one that was

24
00:01:52,008 --> 00:01:59,818
tested and reported. Open WHO's estimate
of excess deaths in 2020 and 2021,

25
00:01:59,868 --> 00:02:05,898
and it's about 14.9 million, nearly
three times the count for those years.

26
00:02:05,948 --> 00:02:09,135
The timeline labels it
what it is: an estimate.

27
00:02:10,685 --> 00:02:16,075
Now follow the science. Separate
by tags, choose vaccine,

28
00:02:16,125 --> 00:02:21,235
and the band runs from the genome's
publication in January 2020.

29
00:02:21,285 --> 00:02:26,845
Sixty-five days later, on March sixteenth,
a volunteer in Seattle gets the first

30
00:02:26,895 --> 00:02:31,315
dose in a vaccine trial.
Large trials begin in July;

31
00:02:31,365 --> 00:02:33,502
in November, the first results.

32
00:02:35,052 --> 00:02:41,492
Open a moment to read it. On December
second, the UK's regulator authorises the

33
00:02:41,542 --> 00:02:48,392
Pfizer–BioNTech vaccine: the first
authorisation anywhere of a COVID-19 vaccine

34
00:02:48,442 --> 00:02:54,402
after a full phase 3 trial. Six
days later, at 6:31 in the morning,

35
00:02:54,452 --> 00:02:59,432
Margaret Keenan, ninety, gets the
first dose given outside a trial.

36
00:02:59,482 --> 00:03:04,192
The reader shows how precisely that's
known, and where it comes from.

37
00:03:04,242 --> 00:03:08,540
The United States authorises the
same vaccine three days later.

38
00:03:10,090 --> 00:03:16,790
The virus changed. Separate the variants:
WHO designates Alpha and Beta variants

39
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:20,740
of concern in December
2020, Gamma in January,

40
00:03:20,790 --> 00:03:27,160
Delta in May 2021, and that month gives
them Greek letters instead of the names

41
00:03:27,210 --> 00:03:32,210
of places. On November twenty-sixth,
two days after South Africa reports it,

42
00:03:32,260 --> 00:03:36,690
Omicron. The waves they
drove sit below as bands,

43
00:03:36,740 --> 00:03:41,166
dated roughly, because waves
have no agreed start or end.

44
00:03:42,716 --> 00:03:50,116
And then the end. On May fifth, 2023, WHO
declares that COVID-19 is no longer a

45
00:03:50,166 --> 00:03:56,006
global health emergency, 1,191
days after declaring it one,

46
00:03:56,056 --> 00:03:59,796
with nearly seven million
deaths reported and, WHO says,

47
00:03:59,846 --> 00:04:05,747
many more uncounted. Six days later,
the United States ends its own.

48
00:04:07,297 --> 00:04:11,757
Anyone can read a public timeline
like this, no account needed.

49
00:04:11,807 --> 00:04:15,387
Build one with your class, for a
year, a country or a single thread,

50
00:04:15,437 --> 00:04:17,949
and share it with a link.
